{"sections":{"image_banner":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Inspired_by_Cinderella_1200_x_400_px_14.svg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"center","show_text_below":false}},"image_with_text_4rrWpk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_JfPGDy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>London, England<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_ggcHNL":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Step into the charming streets and storybook elegance of London, where<em>Mary Poppins<\/em>first brought magic to Number 17 Cherry Tree Lane. Wander through historic parks, explore iconic landmarks, discover quaint neighbourhoods, and enjoy timeless West End theatre that feels lifted from a fairytale.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin your London chapter and add a touch of Mary Poppins magic to your adventure.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_JfPGDy","text_ggcHNL"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/topic-london-gettyimages-760251843-feature.avif","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_wHPt4n":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_kxNwiW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Austria – Salzburg & The Alps<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_4PUjgq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Follow in the footsteps of <em>The Sound of Music<\/em> across Salzburg’s rolling hills, glittering lakes, and baroque city streets. Visit the famous gazebo, Mirabell Gardens, and breathtaking alpine viewpoints that made the story unforgettable. Whether on a musical tour or your own scenic wanderings, it truly feels like stepping into a cinematic fairytale.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to craft your own musical chapter in the Austrian Alps.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_kxNwiW","text_4PUjgq"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/salzburg-to-hallstatt-day-trip.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_EBCCWn":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_KxPYmx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>New York City, USA<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_Vrhadp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Experience the energy of Broadway, where Julie Andrews’ legendary stage career took flight. Explore iconic theatres, cultural landmarks, museums, and historic music venues that celebrate the heart of performing arts. Walk the same avenues where countless beloved stories have come to life.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin your Broadway-inspired chapter in New York City.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_KxPYmx","text_Vrhadp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/GettyImages-946087016.webp","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_dYxihL":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_i46LR4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Switzerland – Lakes & Mountain Villages<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_QiUHhp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Embrace the serene beauty and timeless charm of Switzerland—snow-capped peaks, sparkling lakes, and postcard-perfect villages that feel straight out of a children’s storybook. With scenic train rides, alpine walks, and peaceful lakeside towns, it captures the gentle grace often associated with Julie Andrews’ most beloved roles.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to write your own serene and picturesque Swiss chapter.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_i46LR4","text_QiUHhp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/switzerland.avif","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}}},"order":["image_banner","image_with_text_4rrWpk","image_with_text_wHPt